Finally, please replace your Redis credentials before running this code. 

This is a high-level solution that might not be the most efficient in terms of memory and network bandwidth usage under load spikes as it fetches data for each selector individually rather than batching requests based on categories. Adjust the batch size and retry mechanism to suit your specific use case.
