You would normally call this function like so: `let (exit_code, report, bundle) = compile_with_metrics("config.json");`. The `compile_with_metrics` function returns a tuple containing the exit code of the subprocess running the Rust compiler and a summary report including the compilation time, resident set size changes, and error logs if any.
