However, I can provide some basic architectural concepts or examples of parts of your request:

1) **Dynamic Routing**: To dynamically route requests to the nearest data center, you could use a software load balancer like Nginx with geoIP module. This would allow routing based on source IP address.

```nginx
http {
    # Load module for GeoIP
    geoip_country /usr/local/share/GeoIP/GeoIP.dat;

    server {
        listen 80 default_server;

        location / {
            if ($geoip_country_code ~* "(us)") {
                proxy_pass http://data_center_1;
            }

            if ($geoip_country_code ~* "(de)") {
                proxy_pass http://data_center_2;
            }
        }
    }
}
